//! The 1.21.7 default villager trade table, transcribed from the
//! 1.21.7 server jar's `VillagerTrades.<clinit>` (TRADES plus the
//! wandering-trader pairs). Generated by `vt/emit_trades.py` --
//! do not edit by hand; regenerate from `vt/trades.json`.
//!
//! Vanilla 1.21.7 ships no trade data files; these are the defaults
//! `Trades::load` seeds for any set/trade id the data-driven load
//! (plus pack overlay) did not provide, so a datapack that ships a
//! trade set or trade still wins over the hardcoded entry.
//!
//! Two deliberate deviations from Mojang's 26.1 data files, each
//! grounded in the 1.21.7 jar's `getOffer` (see emit_trades.py):
//! the emerald cost is cost A for the fisherman/fletcher
//! two-cost trades, and dyed armour rolls 1 + B(1, 0.3) + B(1, 0.2) dyes.
//! The experimental trade-rebalance table (EXPERIMENTAL_TRADES,
//! behind the off-by-default `trade_rebalance` feature flag) is
//! NOT transcribed.

